get  2018 iPad unless you're buying the new  2018 iPad pro if you haven't seen our  one year review of the 2018 iPad click  the card above or click the end screen  button at the end of this video we've  already ordered both of the new 2019  iPad so we're gonna be doing in-depth  comparison videos very soon so if you're  not already subscribed make sure to do  that now thanks for watching and we'll  see you in the next video  [Music]
 

